%% The workflow state machine, transcribed edge for edge from the Table dictionary in
%% api/Services/WorkflowTransitions.cs (22 entries, keyed by (state, trigger)). States are
%% exactly the members of api/Models/WorkflowState.cs; edge labels are exactly the members of
%% api/Services/WorkflowTrigger.cs. Nothing here is not in the table.
%% Edges no code path currently fires are listed in 03-architecture.md §3.12.
%% Export: npx -p @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli mmdc -i workflow-state-machine.mmd -o workflow-state-machine.png -s 3 -b white

stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Submitted : created by WorkflowService.StartAsync (not a transition)

    Submitted --> AwaitingClarification : ClarifierAsked
    Submitted --> Diagnosing : ClarifierFoundNothing
    Submitted --> Diagnosing : PlannedWithoutClarification
    Submitted --> Failed : AgentFailed

    AwaitingClarification --> Diagnosing : ReporterAnswered

    Diagnosing --> Strategizing : Diagnosed
    Diagnosing --> Failed : AgentFailed

    Strategizing --> WorkOrderRaised : WorkOrderAutoApproved
    Strategizing --> AwaitingManagerApproval : WorkOrderNeedsApproval
    Strategizing --> Failed : AgentFailed

    AwaitingManagerApproval --> WorkOrderRaised : ManagerApproved
    AwaitingManagerApproval --> Closed : ManagerRejected
    AwaitingManagerApproval --> Strategizing : RevisionRequested

    WorkOrderRaised --> InProgress : WorkStarted
    WorkOrderRaised --> Completed : WorkCompleted
    InProgress --> Completed : WorkCompleted

    Completed --> AwaitingVerification : VerificationDue

    AwaitingVerification --> Closed : RepairVerified
    AwaitingVerification --> Diagnosing : RepairReopened
    AwaitingVerification --> AwaitingManagerApproval : RepairEscalated

    Failed --> WorkOrderRaised : WorkOrderAutoApproved
    Failed --> AwaitingManagerApproval : WorkOrderNeedsApproval

    Closed --> [*]

    note right of Submitted
        The planner runs here. Leaving the clarifier
        out is PlannedWithoutClarification: a different
        fact from ClarifierFoundNothing, same state.
    end note

    note right of AwaitingClarification
        HUMAN PAUSE 1: waiting on the reporter.
        Only POST /api/reports/{id}/clarifications
        (ClarificationService) moves it on.
    end note

    note right of Strategizing
        The runner raises the proposal through the
        approval gate (WorkOrderService.CreateAsync),
        which picks the trigger. When it cannot, a
        manager raises one. A revision re-runs the
        strategist alone and resubmits the same Draft.
    end note

    note left of AwaitingManagerApproval
        HUMAN PAUSE 2: a FacilitiesManager
        approves, rejects (with a reason) or
        requests revision (with a note).
    end note

    note right of InProgress
        Never reached: nothing fires
        WorkStarted (no start endpoint).
    end note

    note right of AwaitingVerification
        The sweep moves it here DelayDays after
        completion. The REPORTER's answer fires
        RepairVerified or RepairReopened.
        Nothing fires RepairEscalated yet.
    end note

    note left of Failed
        A dead or safe-failed agent ends here.
        A manager can still raise an order, and
        Run the agents again starts a new run.
    end note

    classDef waiting fill:#E8E6FC,stroke:#5B50E8,stroke-width:2px,color:#15171C
    classDef terminal fill:#EEF0F3,stroke:#15171C,color:#15171C
    classDef failed fill:#FDECEC,stroke:#B42318,color:#15171C
    class AwaitingClarification,AwaitingManagerApproval waiting
    class Closed terminal
    class Failed failed
